 "description": "Noah's keyboard profile as the authored defaults must reproduce it, in tests/host/profile_logical_form.py's logical form. Derived from his backup of 2026-10-19 (portable document version 3: profile schema 3.0, action ABI 0x837cf479, sixteen layers, 128 macro streams) by decoding it with the schema-3 codecs; the schema-3 and schema-4 domain versions are the same, so every value carries over unchanged. The backup's empty Delete row (0x004c, no steps) is left out, as the authored defaults dropped it: a row without steps is no row (firmware D-F27), so no key changes. The Backspace row (0x002a) comes from his export of 2026-10-25, the one difference that export had from these defaults. Since pointing version 4 the backup's Arrow mouse button overrides are not carried (version 4 retired them; Noah does not use them, 2026-10-25), and settings version 9 holds its auto-sniping layer, Navigation (3), as the layer mask 8. Settings version 10 gives each custom key's shortcut a layer mask and the layer kind they act as; the backup's one shortcut turns no layer on, so its kind is Hold (0). Settings version 11 holds up to six keys in place of the one key; the backup's shortcut is its one key. tests/host/folded_keyboard_profile_test.py compares the compiled defaults with it, domain by domain.",
